%N A054583 Number of nonisomorphic acyclic orientations of the Hamming graph (K_n) x (K_n).
%C A054583 Also number of plans (i.e., structural solutions) of the open shop problem with n jobs and n machines where the jobs may be interchanged with the machines - see problems in scheduling theory.
%D A054583 Martin Harborth, Structural analysis of shop scheduling problems, PhD thesis, Otto-von-Guericke-Univ. Magdeburg, GCA-Verlag, 1999. (in German)
%H A054583 H. Bräsel, M. Harborth, T. Tautenhahn and P. Willenius, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1023/A:1018938915709">On the set of solutions of the open shop problem</a>, Ann. Oper. Res. 92 (1999) 241-263.
%H A054583 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/RookGraph.html">Rook Graph</a>.
